{
  "html": [
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The company has officially announced the successor to its popular product today. After years of waiting, the new model is finally here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Available to order next week"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The new model features a next-generation chip that enables improved performance across the board."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The chip also powers an upgraded noise cancellation experience. Per the company:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "blockquote",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "\"With the incredible performance of the new chip, users get up to 1.5x more effective noise cancellation for the ultimate listening experience,\" said a company spokesperson."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "New features include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ul",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Live Translation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Adaptive Audio"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Voice Isolation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Gesture Controls"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The new model supports high-resolution lossless audio when connected with the included cable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "It costs $549 and will be available to order starting next Wednesday."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The new model comes in five color options: midnight, starlight, orange, purple, and blue."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
